Z||000009||MinnGreenGT||11-21-2001||05:27 PM||||MM- if you're in Adobe PhotoShop, leave the main image on a layer with a transparent background.  The go file-&gt;save as  and select "Compuserve GIF" and be sure that the setting for transparency is selected somewhere in the next box.  Then give it a try!  <P>(Mine isn't the cleanest, but it works...)<P>------------------<BR>              <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/GreenGT6.gif"> ||||reg||1
